F_SCALE_C_LAT(1,2)  1 ! [D] Divided into (force - F_START_C_LAT)

C_LAT_COEFFICIENT(2,1) 9.42e-06 ! Lateral displacement per unit force (mm/N), axle
                                ! 2, left side
